    "expectedRule": "Chapter 18 records three takes in order at take_alpha, take_beta and take_gamma: the first direct action (attack, art or guard) of each take fight is recorded with the value it produced. Leaving a take node needs its take (`录制当前战斗母带后才能离开。`); entering the next take node needs the earlier takes. Route nodes open only for the selected route (`三段母带完成后选择顺序路线；其余路线将永久关闭。` for sequence_route), and the boss edges need three takes plus a route; an edge with several conditions reads `需同时满足这条战痕复演门的全部条件。`. After three takes law/select-combat-replay-route fixes the route once; another selection changes nothing. Display: title 战痕复演律; severity danger before three takes, warning ready for a route, stable ready for the boss, resolved once frozen; meter {takes, 3}; targetReached when ready for the boss. Selecting the boss freezes {takes, route}. The recorded values depend on combat and are not asserted; the actions are. An art costs 1 focus and fights start at 0 focus, so the art take first spends the gate_sense method technique (rank 1: +1 focus, not a combat action). take_beta is an elite, so its loot offer is declined before moving on. The pursuer is a separate run system and is disabled after entry so it cannot ambush the walk. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
